{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1418180/extras/888c59300eeb3cae8925c24f47a79554.avif?t=1748835223\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1418180/extras_big/888c59300eeb3cae8925c24f47a79554.avif?t=1748835223 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This visual novel is an emotional tale about people brought together by rock 'n roll who are questioning the meaning of their lives, struggling to find a place within society, and agonizing over what music truly means to them.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1418180/extras/1e6aa9d08d913c6c7edf276920d0bccc.avif?t=1748835223\" width=262 height=83 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as Kei, a young man from a family line of doctors who is  forced him to question his path in life after certain events throw him off the rails laid before him. Through rock 'n roll you'll meet interesting people who offer new takes on life and ideals regarding music. Very few approaches you can take will prove all good or all bad, and nearly all will involve sacrificing something.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1418180/extras/b100464b907118fa01854f8b6dfa5d66.avif?t=1748835223\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1418180/extras_big/b100464b907118fa01854f8b6dfa5d66.avif?t=1748835223 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you abandon music and choose another path? Will you try to value each moment as it comes? Will you do whatever it takes to become a financial success? Dramatic stories will unfold as the consequence of the path you choose.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1418180/extras/62e43ee4ff267ebd53dbbe2bade80d64.avif?t=1748835223\" width=359 height=141 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1418180/extras/b54ba896d7452b6543059f5c0099bd7c.poster.avif?t=1748835223\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1418180/extras/b54ba896d7452b6543059f5c0099bd7c.webm?t=1748835223\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1418180/extras/b54ba896d7452b6543059f5c0099bd7c.mp4?t=1748835223\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>As a Japanese indie rock artist himself, the producer of this game brings a depth of detail into the lives and culture of indie rock artists that enhances the atmosphere and setting in ways that few others can lay claim to.</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1418180/extras/bc6bd77118d39f171aa5510b83b8d4ea.poster.avif?t=1748835223\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1418180/extras/bc6bd77118d39f171aa5510b83b8d4ea.webm?t=1748835223\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1418180/extras/bc6bd77118d39f171aa5510b83b8d4ea.mp4?t=1748835223\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>In addition to the rockin' background tracks used for ambience during the story, this game contains a full CD's worth of original rock songs created explicitly to represent the tones and styles of the different bands that perform in-game.</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1418180/extras/3d1ec02d751a2f0c994368dd505302cd.poster.avif?t=1748835223\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1418180/extras/3d1ec02d751a2f0c994368dd505302cd.webm?t=1748835223\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1418180/extras/3d1ec02d751a2f0c994368dd505302cd.mp4?t=1748835223\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The decisions you make throughout the game will lead you down one of five potential paths, each fully fleshed out with many hours of content delving into the consequences of each road taken.</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1418180/extras/f428ce42c0efc2cecc64ac024f47c85b.poster.avif?t=1748835223\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1418180/extras/f428ce42c0efc2cecc64ac024f47c85b.webm?t=1748835223\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1418180/extras/f428ce42c0efc2cecc64ac024f47c85b.mp4?t=1748835223\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Aside from the protagonist Kei, all of the characters both major and minor are fully voiced throughout the story, bringing another layer of richness and depth.</strong></p></li></ul>","